        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "SECTION 19.1. The Union agrees that neither the Union nor its members will intimidate or coerce employees, or solicit memberships or funds or engage in any other Union activity, whatsoever on Company premises to the extent that any such activity interferes with the proper and efficient performance by its employees of their duties.",
