        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "SECTION 19.2. During the life of this Agreement, the Union will not cause a strike, nor will any employee or employees take a part in a strike, intentional slow down in rate of work, or any other interference or stoppage of the Company's work. Any employee who so violates this Section, or participates in its violation, shall be subject to immediate discharge.",
